  "_comment": "Role families used to read a CV, tier the roles worth targeting, and recognise a job's type. For each family: label; titles (regexes matched against a job or CV title); keywords (skills/tools matched against CV and advert text); searches (job-board queries); adjacent (families a person in this one can move to); sponsor ('usual' = normally degree-level, can be sponsored; 'check' = depends on the exact duties; 'rare' = usually below the Skilled Worker skill level, so even licensed sponsors seldom sponsor it). Edit freely: both the CV scan and the matching read this file.",
